  "title": "Caramelized Oatmeal Raisin Muffins",
  "description": "Why can't oatmeal muffins taste more like oatmeal cookies? These do! The trick is to first caramelize the oatmeal. Enjoy the nice, deep oatmeal flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "Chantal Pare"
